## Access rules
## Default action is set in xabber_ws.config. Set 'allow_all' parameter to true or false (restart required).
## After changing this file, reload rules in the running server:
##   ./bin/reload_accessrules
## Rule examples:
##  rule      server(xmpp domain)
## -----------------------------
##  allow     myserver.com
##  deny      alienserver.com
